  "description": "Neutral secrets/configuration abstraction for Benzene: a provider-agnostic ISecretStore seam (env vars, mounted files, in-memory, composed, cached) plus fail-fast startup validation and typed resolution, so an application ports across clouds without coupling to any one secret backend. BCL-only; cloud provider adapters (Key Vault, AWS Secrets Manager, ...) implement the same one-method interface.",
